    "status_notes": [
      "Articles 98(1)(b), 99 and 100 were repealed by POJK 38/2025 Article 20; Article 115(9) was repealed by POJK 39/2025 Article 16(f). Selected collection and complaint provisions are not those repealed provisions.",
      "Article 62(3) consent exception is retained as source context only. Graceline remains stricter: no Sunday/holiday/out-of-hours dispatch and no third-party collection. Legal ingestion must not change these hard rules.",
      "Article 62 explanation defines continuous contact as more than three times per day. A stricter product cap is permitted and remains code/config.",
      "Article 75 does not impose a universal 20-business-day SLA: initial written complaint deadline is 10 business days after complete documents, with conditional extension and separate follow-up provisions."
    ],
